572	{"artifactId":"LLD-315d510cb28100e2-s8","entry":{"id":"5feec0481fca41678f0dbbb53fc1961c","actor":{"id":"insrc:approval","kind":"system","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-10-22T20:26:41.893Z","operation":"ack-stale","revision":{"number":6,"contentHash":"4feef4e3b4ef5eebd7b7db3bed2855ccb9ec9467fd444a1eb3f63182a8e69587"},"outcome":{"result":"acknowledged","summary":"The LLD itself proposed AMD-315d510cb28100e2-27 (sc1) and AMD-315d510cb28100e2-28 (sc3); both were approved by the user together with the LLD, so the HLD change is the one the LLD was designed against."}}}
